<title>UK: London gold fixes easier in quiet, sideways Europe.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes easier in quiet, sideways Europe.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixes at $340.95 versus $341.40 on Friday PM. Seen in tight range, support at $340. Activity lessened with many players away at Financial Times gold conference.</p>
<p>SILVER - Also slow. $4.70/4.72, down two cents.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Off $4.00 at $433.00/438.00. Also very quiet, still awaiting news of Russian exports.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM- Up $1.00 at $203.00/208.00. Support at $200.00.</p>
</text>
